 <h3><u>Ali imam e man asto manam ghulam e ali</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Ali ali ali ali ali..(4)<br> Hai kayenaat me..(2)<br> tauheed ki jo shamma jali<br> Usi ke noor ka..(2)<br> jalwa hai mustafa o ali<br> Ali imam e man asto manam ghulam e ali..(2)</p> 
  <p>1. Karam khuda ka hua hogaye wo shere khuda<br> bahaduri me koi hai kahan ali jaisa..(2)<br> hasan husain ke baba..(2)<br> wo janesaar e nabi</p> 
  <p>2. Mila jo hukm e ilahi buto'n ko tha dhaya<br> khuda ne taaje wilayat inhi ko pehnaya..(2)<br> ali ka ghar hai jahan..(2)<br> aale mustafa hai pali</p> 
  <p>3. Hua ishara e haider gira dare khaibar<br> shikare teghe ali the jo marhabo antar..(2)<br> misaale balk wo..(2)<br> maidaa'n me zulfiqar chali</p> 
  <p>4. Ali wali hai mujahid hai shere yazdaa'n hai<br> huzoor ne ye kaha tha wo kulle eemaa'n hai..(2)<br> haq unke saath hamesha..(2)<br> aur uske saath ali</p> 
  <p>5. Kisi ne martaba e buturaab kab jaana<br> faqat khuda o nabi ne ali ko pehchana..(2)<br> jo puchna hai to pucho..(2)<br> inhi se kya hai ali</p> 
  <p>6. Na dusra hai ali aur na koi aisa jari<br> na aasmaan ne dekha zamee pe aisa sakhi..(2)<br> na khali haath gaya..(2)<br> koi jiske darr se kabhi</p> 
  <p>7. Khitaab ho ke bayaa hai wo marefat ka nisha<br> ali ki danish o hikmat hai faislo se ayaa..(2)<br> hai lazawal riwayat..(2)<br> jaha'n me adl e ali</p> 
  <p>8. Agar kahi koi banda ho mushkilo me ghira<br> madad ko aate hai maula ali ba hukm e khuda..(2)<br> abhi jo koi pukare..(2)<br> madad ko aaye abhi</p> 
  <p>9. Khuda hai maula to 'safdar' hai mustafa maula<br> nabi ne khum me kaha tha ke hai ali maula..(2)<br> nabi hai jiske bhi maula..(2)<br> kamaal usike ali<br> Ali imam e man asto manam ghulam e ali..(2)<br> Ali ali ali ali ali..(2)</p> 
